      "text": "The brittle grain-boundary phases compromise mechanical integrity and promote crack initiation and propagation under thermal or mechanical stress.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing the Al content will decrease brittle oxide-phase formation at grain boundaries.",
